o editing, 3D and gaming\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Nimbus 13\",\n    \"tagline\": \"Everything you need, for less\",\n    \"price\": 999,\n    \"weightKg\": 1,\n    \"batteryH\": 22,\n    \"screen\": \"13\\\" IPS\",\n    \"cpu\": \"6-core, 15 W\",\n    \"ramGb\": 16,\n    \"storageGb\": 256,\n    \"ports\": [\n      \"2x USB-C\",\n      \"headphone\"\n    ],\n    \"rating\": 4.2,\n    \"reviews\": 2310,\n    \"pros\": [\n      \"Lightest\",\n      \"Best battery life\",\n      \"Lowest price\"\n    ],\n    \"cons\": [\n      \"Dimmer screen\",\n      \"Small SSD\"\n    ],\n    \"bestFor\": \"Students and light office work\"\n  }\n]","systemHash":"dcc43620444bd5561aa7a57e09f50adaace10b9cc1a0c5f2f824f41f6ed0f15b","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n\n  <header class=\"stack\">\n    <h1>Pick your laptop: Aero 14 vs Forge 16 vs Nimbus 13</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead\">Three very good machines, three very different jobs. Compare every spec side-by-side, see where each one wins, and let the priority picker point you at the right one.</p>\n    <p class=\"muted small\">Prices as of Oct 2026 · 5,110 owner reviews analysed · <span class=\"up\">Green</span> marks the best value in each table row.</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <hr>\n\n  <!-- ══ At a glance ══ -->\n  <section class=\"stack\">\n    <h2>At a glance</h2>\n    <div class=\"grid cols-3\">\n\n      <div class=\"card stack\">\n        <div class=\"row between center\">\n          <span class=\"badge\">Highest rated</span>\n          <span class=\"muted small\">★ 4.6 · 1,840 reviews</span>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <h3 class=\"card-title\">Aero 14</h3>\n          <p class=\"card-desc\">Light, bright, long-lasting</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stat-value\">$1,299</div>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm small\">\n          <div class=\"row between\"><span class=\"muted\">Weight</span><span>1.2 kg</span></div>\n          <div class=\"row between\"><span class=\"muted\">Battery</span><span>18 h</span></div>\n          <div class=\"row between\"><span class=\"muted\">Screen</span><span>14\" OLED</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"progress\"><div style=\"width:92%\"></div></div>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">Best for: <strong>Travel and everyday work</strong></p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card stack\">\n        <div class=\"row between center\">\n          <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Most powerful</span>\n          <span class=\"muted small\">★ 4.4 · 960 reviews</span>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <h3 class=\"card-title\">Forge 16</h3>\n          <p class=\"card-desc\">Desktop power on the go</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stat-value\">$1,899</div>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm small\">\n          <div class=\"row between\"><span class=\"muted\">Weight</span><span>2.1 kg</span></div>\n          <div class=\"row between\"><span class=\"muted\">Battery</span><span>9 h</span></div>\n          <div class=\"row between\"><span class=\"muted\">Screen</span><span>16\" IPS 165Hz</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"progress\"><div style=\"width:88%\"></div></div>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">Best for: <strong>Video editing, 3D and gaming</strong></p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card stack\">\n        <div class=\"row between center\">\n          <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Best value</span>\n          <span class=\"muted small\">★ 4.2 · 2,310 reviews</span>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <h3 class=\"card-title\">Nimbus 13</h3>\n          <p class=\"card-desc\">Everything you need, for less</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stat-value\">$999</div>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm small\">\n          <div class=\"row between\"><span class=\"muted\">Weight</span><span>1.0 kg</span></div>\n          <div class=\"row between\"><span class=\"muted\">Battery</span><span>22 h</span></div>\n          <div class=\"row between\"><span class=\"muted\">Screen</span><span>13\" IPS</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"progress\"><div style=\"width:84%\"></div></div>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">Best for: <strong>Students and light office work</strong></p>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <hr>\n\n  <!-- ══ Priority picker ══ -->\n  <section class=\"stack\">\n    <h2>What matters most to you?</h2>\n    <p class=\"muted\">Tap a priority and we'll point you at the right machine.</p>\n    <div class=\"row gap-sm\" id=\"prio\" style=\"flex-wrap:wrap\">\n      <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" data-p=\"travel\">🎒 Travel light</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" data-p=\"power\">⚡ Create &amp; game</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" data-p=\"battery\">🔋 Battery all day</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" data-p=\"budget\">💸 Spend the least</button>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"muted small\" id=\"prioHint\">No priority selected yet — pick one above.</p>\n\n    <div id=\"prioCards\">\n      <div class=\"card stack\" data-card=\"travel\" hidden>\n        <div class=\"row between center\"><h3 class=\"card-title\">→ Nimbus 13</h3><span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Pick</span></div>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">At 1.0 kg it's the lightest of the three, and its 22-hour battery means the charger can stay home. Everything a traveller actually needs for $999.</p>\n        <p class=\"small muted\"><strong>Runner-up:</strong> Aero 14 — only 0.2 kg heavier but adds a gorgeous OLED panel, for $300 more.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card stack\" data-card=\"power\" hidden>\n        <div class=\"row between center\"><h3 class=\"card-title\">→ Forge 16</h3><span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Pick</span></div>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">16 cores at 55 W, 32 GB of RAM and a 165 Hz panel — it out-guns both rivals for editing, rendering and gaming, and its RAM and SSD are upgradeable later.</p>\n        <p class=\"small muted\"><strong>Trade-off:</strong> 2.1 kg, audible fans and only 9 h of battery. If you mostly work plugged in at a desk, that's a fair deal.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card stack\" data-card=\"battery\" hidden>\n        <div class=\"row between center\"><h3 class=\"card-title\">→ Nimbus 13</h3><span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Pick</span></div>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">22 hours — the best here, and 2.4× the Forge 16. Its efficient 6-core, 15 W chip sips power, and at 1.0 kg it disappears into a bag.</p>\n        <p class=\"small muted\"><strong>Runner-up:</strong> Aero 14 still manages a very respectable 18 h if you want a bigger, brighter screen.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card stack\" data-card=\"budget\" hidden>\n        <div class=\"row between center\"><h3 class=\"card-title\">→ Nimbus 13</h3><span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Pick</span></div>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">$999 — $300 less than the Aero 14 and $900 less than the Forge 16. You still get 16 GB of RAM and the same port layout as the Aero.</p>\n        <p class=\"small muted\"><strong>Worth considering:</strong> stretching to the Aero 14 ($1,299) doubles your storage to 512 GB and adds an OLED display.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <hr>\n\n  <!-- ══ Full spec table ══ -->\n  <section class=\"stack\">\n    <h2>Full comparison</h2>\n    <table class=\"table\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr><th>Spec</th><th>Aero 14</th><th>Forge 16</th><th>Nimbus 13</th></tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td>Price</td><td class=\"num\">$1,299</td><td class=\"num\">$1,899</td><td class=\"num up\">$999</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Weight</td><td class=\"num\">1.2 kg</td><td class=\"num\">2.1 kg</td><td class=\"num up\">1.0 kg</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Battery life</td><td class=\"num\">18 h</td><td class=\"num\">9 h</td><td class=\"num up\">22 h</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Screen</td><td>14\" OLED</td><td>16\" IPS 165Hz</td><td>13\" IPS</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>CPU</td><td>8-core, 15 W</td><td class=\"up\">16-core, 55 W</td><td>6-core, 15 W</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>RAM</td><td class=\"num\">16 GB</td><td class=\"num up\">32 GB</td><td class=\"num\">16 GB</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Storage</td><td class=\"num\">512 GB</td><td class=\"num up\">1,024 GB</td><td class=\"num\">256 GB</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Ports</td>\n          <td class=\"small\">2x USB-C · HDMI · headphone</td>\n          <td class=\"small up\">2x USB-C · 3x USB-A · HDMI · Ethernet · SD card</td>\n          <td class=\"small\">2x USB-C · headphone</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Owner rating</td><td class=\"num up\">★ 4.6</td><td class=\"num\">★ 4.4</td><td class=\"num\">★ 4.2</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Reviews</td><td class=\"num\">1,840</td><td class=\"num\">960</td><td class=\"num up\">2,310</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Cost per GB of storage</td><td class=\"num\">$2.54</td><td class=\"num up\">$1.85</td><td class=\"num\">$3.90</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Best for</td>\n          <td class=\"small\">Travel and everyday work</td>\n          <td class=\"small\">Video editing, 3D and gaming</td>\n          <td class=\"small\">Students and light office work</td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n    <p class=\"muted small\">Screen row has no single winner: the Aero's OLED is the best for colour and contrast, the Forge's 165 Hz panel is the smoothest for games, the Nimbus panel is the dimmest of the three.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <hr>\n\n  <!-- ══ Charts ══ -->\n  <section class=\"stack\">\n    <h2>The numbers, visualised</h2>\n    <div class=\"grid cols-2\">\n      <div class=\"card\"><div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar\",\"title\":\"Price (USD) — lower is better\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Aero 14\",\"value\":1299},{\"label\":\"Forge 16\",\"value\":1899},{\"label\":\"Nimbus 13\",\"value\":999}]}'></div></div>\n      <div class=\"card\"><div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar\",\"title\":\"Battery life (hours) — higher is better\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Aero 14\",\"value\":18},{\"label\":\"Forge 16\",\"value\":9},{\"label\":\"Nimbus 13\",\"value\":22}]}'></div></div>\n      <div class=\"card\"><div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar\",\"title\":\"Weight (kg) — lower is better\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Aero 14\",\"value\":1.2},{\"label\":\"Forge 16\",\"value\":2.1},{\"label\":\"Nimbus 13\",\"value\":1.0}]}'></div></div>\n      <div class=\"card\"><div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar\",\"title\":\"Owner rating (out of 5)\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Aero 14\",\"value\":4.6},{\"label\":\"Forge 16\",\"value\":4.4},{\"label\":\"Nimbus 13\",\"value\":4.2}]}'></div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid cols-2\">\n      <div class=\"card\"><div data-chart='{\"type\":\"pie\",\"title\":\"Share of 5,110 owner reviews\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Aero 14 (1,840)\",\"value\":1840},{\"label\":\"Forge 16 (960)\",\"value\":960},{\"label\":\"Nimbus 13 (2,310)\",\"value\":2310}]}'></div></div>\n      <div class=\"card stack\">\n        <h3 class=\"card-title\">What owners say</h3>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">All three hold strong ratings (4.2–4.6), but the feedback profile differs:</p>\n        <ul class=\"stack gap-sm small\">\n          <li><strong>Nimbus 13</strong> is the most-reviewed by far (45% of all feedback) — a sign of huge volume at the $999 price.</li>\n          <li><strong>Aero 14</strong> posts the highest satisfaction score of the trio at 4.6.</li>\n          <li><strong>Forge 16</strong> has the fewest reviews — it's a niche pick for power users, at the highest price.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <hr>\n\n  <!-- ══ Pros & cons ══ -->\n  <section class=\"stack\">\n    <h2>Strengths &amp; compromises</h2>\n    <div class=\"grid cols-3\">\n\n      <div class=\"card stack\">\n        <h3 class=\"card-title\">Aero 14</h3>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm small\">\n          <div><span class=\"up\">＋</span> Gorgeous OLED panel</div>\n          <div><span class=\"up\">＋</span> Great battery</div>\n          <div><span class=\"up\">＋</span> Quiet under load</div>\n          <div><span class=\"down\">－</span> Soldered RAM</div>\n          <div><span class=\"down\">－</span> Glossy screen</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card stack\">\n        <h3 class=\"card-title\">Forge 16</h3>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm small\">\n          <div><span class=\"up\">＋</span> Fastest of the three</div>\n          <div><span class=\"up\">＋</span> Upgradeable RAM and SSD</div>\n          <div><span class=\"up\">＋</span> Full port selection</div>\n          <div><span class=\"down\">－</span> Heavy</div>\n          <div><span class=\"down\">－</span> Fans are audible</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card stack\">\n        <h3 class=\"card-title\">Nimbus 13</h3>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm small\">\n          <div><span class=\"up\">＋</span> Lightest</div>\n          <div><span class=\"up\">＋</span> Best battery life</div>\n          <div><span class=\"up\">＋</span> Lowest price</div>\n          <div><span class=\"down\">－</span> Dimmer screen</div>\n          <div><span class=\"down\">－</span> Small SSD</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <hr>\n\n  <!-- ══ Verdict ══ -->\n  <section class=\"stack\">\n    <h2>The verdict</h2>\n    <div class=\"alert\">\n      <strong>There's no single \"best\" laptop here — the Forge 16's 9-hour battery is half the Aero's and a quarter of the Nimbus's, so power and endurance don't live in one chassis.</strong> Decide which trade-off you can live with, then buy accordingly.\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid cols-3\">\n      <div class=\"card stack\">\n        <h4 class=\"card-title\">Buy the Aero 14 if…</h4>\n        <p class=\"small card-desc\">you want the best all-rounder: the group's best screen, the highest owner rating, 18 h of battery and a quiet chassis at 1.2 kg. $1,299 is the sensible middle ground.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card stack\">\n        <h4 class=\"card-title\">Buy the Forge 16 if…</h4>\n        <p class=\"small card-desc\">your workload needs its 16-core CPU, 32 GB RAM and 1 TB SSD, and you value upgradeability and ports over weight. Just keep the charger handy.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card stack\">\n        <h4 class=\"card-title\">Buy the Nimbus 13 if…</h4>\n        <p class=\"small card-desc\">budget, weight and battery are everything. $999, 1.0 kg, 22 h — only upgrade your expectations for the screen and the 256 GB SSD.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  [hidden]{display:none!important}\n  #prio .sel{font-weight:600; box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 2px currentColor}\n</style>\n\n<script>\n  (function(){\n    var btns=document.querySelectorAll('#prio .btn');\n    var cards=document.querySelectorAll('#prioCards [data-card]');\n    var hint=document.getElementById('prioHint');\n    btns.forEach(function(b){\n      b.addEventListener('click',function(){\n        btns.forEach(function(x){x.classList.remove('sel');x.setAttribute('aria-pressed','false');});\n        b.classList.add('sel');\n        b.setAttribute('aria-pressed','true');\n        var p=b.dataset.p;\n        cards.forEach(function(c){c.hidden=c.dataset.card!==p;});\n        if(hint)hint.hidden=true;\n      });\n    });\n  })();\n</script>","deltas":[[168551,"<div class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n\n  <header class=\"stack\">\n    <h1>Pick your laptop: Aero 14 vs Forge 16 vs Nimbus 13</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead\">Three very good machines, three very different jobs. Compare every spec side-by-side, see where each one wins, and let the priority picker point you at the right one.</p>\n    <p class=\"muted small\">Prices as of Oct 2026 · 5,110 owner reviews analysed · <span class=\"up\">Green</span> marks the best value in each table row.</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <hr>\n\n  <!-- ══ At a glance ══ -->\n  <section class=\"stack\">\n    <h2>At a glance</h2>\n    <div class=\"grid cols-3\">\n\n 